one di violenza investe la comunità e Charlie si trova direttamente coinvolta come testimone, il padre Rusty chiede a Sam di tornare a casa. L’indagine sulle morti avvenute nella scuola locale fa emergere ricordi e contraddizioni legati al passato.","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2026-11-12","endDate":"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z","status":"Returning Series","mediaType":"Miniserie","rating":10,"ratingCount":4,"contentScore":94,"numberOfEpisodes":6,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Dramma","Mistero"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Stato":"Terminato","Tipo":"Miniserie","Lingua Originale":"Inglese"},"keywords":["based on novel or book","miniseries","psychological thriller","suspense thriller"],"networks":[{"id":3353,"name":"Peacock","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIAcGTjKKr0KOHL5s4O36roJ8p7.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":9827,"name":"Rose Byrne","role":"Samantha Quinn","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg"},{"id":1028899,"name":"Meghann Fahy","role":"Charlotte Quinn","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vn1JwgdLoFerqqgzcg61tgCJ0ZE.jpg"},{"id":2039,"name":"Brendan Gleeson","role":"Rusty","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ctPPJu5ZYDZr1IPmzoNpezczrm0.jpg"},{"id":1215937,"name":"Harper Steele","role":"Lenore","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jWo1tHt9UDUBaf8m5YgNyH7kOUV.jpg"},{"id":76068,"name":"Michael Dorman","role":"Ben","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Ut9ofZ7fJAvLZ95LVLO1Lepbuc.jpg"},{"id":1918851,"name":"Audrey Grace Marshall","role":"Young Sam","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9j51KnphsW0zg05nCOXxXKlWex.jpg"},{"id":5319631,"name":"Drew Cheek","role":"Young Charlie","episodeCount":6},{"id":11616,"name":"Olivia Williams","role":"Harriet 'Gamma' Quinn","episodeCount":6,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnL7XGfLiAbhqIjV